          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વાટાઘાટ — vāṭāghāṭ — \"negotiations\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો વાટાઘાટ સારી ચાલશે તો કાલે કારખાનું ફરી ખૂલશે. jo vāṭāghāṭ sārī cālśe to kāle kārkhānũ pharī khūlśe. If the talks go well, the factory will open again tomorrow."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વાટાઘાટ (vāṭāghāṭ) is a jingling pair of words for talk back and forth between two sides. No dictionary we use records an older form, so its history is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
